From 48acee90e11e266a232fd131663be9b4bf0df42c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nvkudva <nvkudva@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 06:25:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Samsung Internet build target for uBO Lite

New 'samsung' platform for tools/make-mv3.sh: Chromium manifest without
offscreen or keyboard commands, optional userScripts, a guarded offscreen
shim, and a rebranding step driven by platform/mv3/samsung/brand.json.
Adds a workflow that builds the Galaxy Store package.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
